## RULES

```elixir
rules=
"""
cmd cmdZ { sleep 5 && echo hi } only, node0;
cmd cmdA { mkdir -p $HOME/JAR_OF_DIRT } low, node0;
cmd cmdB { cd $HOME/JAR_OF_DIRT && touch amazing && echo bye } node0;
run cmdZ;
run cmdA then cmdB;
"""

{cmds, rules} = ExMan.loadrules(rules)
:ok
```

```elixir
Main.stop
```

```elixir
{:ok, pid} = Main.initialize(cmds, rules)
```

